==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|bracelet}}, diminutive form of {{m|fro|bras||arm}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|/ˈbɹeɪslət/|/ˈbɹeɪslɪt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[band]] or [[chain]] worn around the [[wrist]] as [[jewelry]]/[[jewellery]] or an [[ornament]].
# The [[strap]] of a [[wristwatch]], used to secure it around the wrist.
# {{lb|en|historical}} A piece of [[defensive]] [[armour]] for the [[arm]].
#: {{rfquotek|Johnson}}
#: See reference below for a definition by John Brown related to bracelets and armor
